[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/188","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/188/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/188/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/188/events","html_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/188","id":5408344329,"node_id":"PR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABC8TDjQ","number":188,"title":"✨ Projects: a board-wide filter and an x toggle that hides closed items","user":{"login":"td72","id":12109493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12109493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72","html_url":"https://github.com/td72","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10179374926,"node_id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-10T05:49:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:02:54Z","closed_at":"2026-09-10T06:02:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/pulls/188","html_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/188","diff_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/188.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/188.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-10T06:02:51Z"},"body":"Closes #185\n\n## What\n\n- **`projects-filter \"<expression>\"`** (top-level) — a filter stacked on every view of the Projects page, saved or local: the view's filter, this one and the closed toggle are joined into one expression, so every term must hold. `(N filtered out)` counts everything hidden.\n- **`is:open` / `is:closed` / `is:merged`** — the board's GraphQL items query also reads the content's `state`; `ItemContent.state` (`#[serde(default)]`, disk-cache compatible) feeds `ProjectItem::state()`. A merged PR counts as closed as well as merged; an item without a known state (drafts, the CLI fallback path, older caches) counts as open. These were reported as unsupported before.\n- **`x`** — `BoardAction::ToggleClosed` hides closed issues and merged / closed PRs on top of whichever view is shown; the header says `· closed hidden`, a status message confirms. Survives refreshes and view switches. **`projects-hide-closed \"on\" | \"off\"`** (default `off`) sets the start state.\n\n## Docs / demo\n\nConfig Reference (en / ja: two new sections with CI-verified examples, table rows, unknown-block list, defaults dump), the Projects chapter (filter paragraph + key row + a paragraph on the stacked filters), README (en / ja), `assets/default.kdl` (`projects-hide-closed \"off\"`, a commented `projects-filter`, the `x` key). Fixtures re-recorded so the demo items carry `state` (7 of 8 are closed); the Projects demo presses `x` twice.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `state_terms_follow_the_content_state` (filter), the unsupported-token test now uses `is:archived`\n- `x_hides_closed_items_and_the_global_filter_stacks_on_the_view` (board pane)\n- `projects_filter_and_hide_closed_default_override_and_validation` (loader)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","closed_by":{"login":"td72","id":12109493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12109493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72","html_url":"https://github.com/td72","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/td72/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/188/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/td72/vig/issues/188/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}]
